So I like to keep it really, really, really simple in terms of like what I need to do because I get really like my blog post was saying all these tools I use and like I like to be hyper organized so I get really like I get really like my blog post was saying all these tools I use and like I like to be hyper organized so I get really like I'm really frazzled if I don't have a very clear cut path of where I'm going next.

