00:54:37,120 --> 00:54:43,760
Like, it's just so fun seeing someone launch an app, because you know, you have like the butterflies the night before, you never know how it's really going to go.

729
00:54:44,560 --> 00:54:51,360
And I joked with people before, like, I've had my heart broken by the App Store tons of times, so it's like, I wasn't really expecting much of anything.

